h ``&quot;... is no longer here&quot;``\nPERSONAL_EXPERIENCE node). A future refactor that moves the\npreservation call below the mutation would silently lose the\nhearsay; this test catches that.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"eb35b0a60cb12580219205a9f62fe5d1","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6354f01696b3cf47614e5a1990ebc457","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"teardown":[{"id":"4c2916b52b8202762d7b1bd796cdf68f","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_effect_applier_memory_preservation"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_effect_applier_memory_preservation.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[],"order":1114,"categories":[]}